# Deel
> Deel is a global HR and payroll platform that lets companies hire employees and contractors in 150+ countries without setting up local entities. It combines payroll, HR, IT, compliance, and benefits into one platform.

Deel serves 35,000+ customers from startups to enterprises like Shopify, Nike, and Klarna. Common use cases include hiring internationally via Employer of Record (EOR), running multi-country payroll, managing distributed teams, and staying compliant with local labor laws. Unlike aggregators, Deel owns its payroll infrastructure and operates legal entities in 100+ countries directly. The platform is SOC 2 Type II certified, ISO 27001 compliant, and GDPR compliant.

Typical audiences: HR leaders evaluating global hiring solutions, finance teams comparing payroll providers, legal teams assessing compliance risk, and IT teams managing distributed device fleets.

For a complete index of all content on deel.com (4,000+ pages), see [llms-full.txt](https://www.deel.com/llms-full.txt).

## Hiring & Payroll

- [Payroll Overview](https://www.deel.com/payroll/): Consolidated payroll across 150+ countries — local, global, and US payroll in one platform.
- [Employer of Record](https://www.deel.com/payroll/hire-employees/): Hire full-time employees in countries where you don't have a legal entity. Deel is the legal employer and handles payroll, taxes, and compliance.
- [Hire Contractors](https://www.deel.com/solutions/payroll/contractors/): Engage and pay contractors globally with compliant contracts, automated payments, and tax document collection.
- [Contractor of Record](https://www.deel.com/payroll/contractor-of-record/): Deel acts as the agent of record for contractors to reduce misclassification risk.
- [PEO](https://www.deel.com/payroll/peo/): Co-employment model for US companies that want outsourced HR, payroll, and benefits administration.
- [Global Payroll](https://www.deel.com/payroll/global/): Multi-country payroll processing with local compliance, tax filing, and reporting.
- [US Payroll](https://www.deel.com/payroll/us/): Payroll for US-based employees across all 50 states with tax calculations and filings.

## HR

- [HR Overview](https://www.deel.com/hr/): Workforce management tools including onboarding, time off, org charts, and document management.
- [HRIS](https://www.deel.com/hr-platform/hris/): Core HR system of record — employee profiles, onboarding workflows, PTO tracking, and reporting.
- [Workforce Planning](https://www.deel.com/hr/workforce-planning/): Headcount planning, scenario modeling, and approval workflows for HR and finance teams.
- [Compensation Management](https://www.deel.com/hr/compensation-management/): Global pay review cycles, benchmarking, and compensation band management.
- [Employee Engagement](https://www.deel.com/hr/engage/): Performance reviews, career development frameworks, learning management, and surveys.
- [Talent Sourcing](https://www.deel.com/hr/talent-sourcing/): Recruitment marketplace connecting companies with vetted recruiting agencies.
- [Employee Benefits](https://www.deel.com/hr/employee-benefits-software/): Benefits administration with carrier integrations and payroll deduction sync.
- [Employee Immigration](https://www.deel.com/hr-services/employee-immigration/): Visa and work permit processing for employee relocations across countries.
- [Background Checks](https://www.deel.com/hr-services/employee-background-checks/): Employment screening in 190+ countries, integrated into the onboarding workflow.
- [Employee Equity](https://www.deel.com/hr-services/employee-equity/): Stock option and equity plan administration in 110+ countries with tax compliance.

## IT

- [IT Overview](https://www.deel.com/it/): IT management for distributed teams — device procurement, security, and access management integrated with HR.
- [Device Lifecycle Management](https://www.deel.com/it/device-lifecycle-management/): Procure, ship, manage, and recover devices for employees in any country.
- [Mobile Device Management](https://www.deel.com/it/mobile-device-management/): Remote device configuration, updates, and security policies across operating systems.
- [Endpoint Protection](https://www.deel.com/it/endpoint-protection/): Threat monitoring and device security for the distributed workforce.
- [Identity & Access Management](https://www.deel.com/it/identity-access-management/): Automated app provisioning and de-provisioning tied to HR events.

## Platform & Integrations

- [Platform Overview](https://www.deel.com/hr-platform/): The unified platform connecting all Deel products — payroll, HR, IT, compliance, and reporting.
- [Deel AI](https://www.deel.com/hr-platform/ai/): AI assistant trained on Deel's compliance and HR data across 150+ countries.
- [Compliance](https://www.deel.com/hr-platform/compliance/): Automated contract generation, tax form collection, and local labor law compliance.
- [Integrations](https://www.deel.com/integrations/): Pre-built connectors for HRIS, accounting, ATS, and collaboration tools.
- [API](https://www.deel.com/hr-platform/api/): REST API for syncing employee, payroll, and contractor data with external systems.
- [White Label](https://www.deel.com/hr-platform/white-label/): Embed Deel's payroll and HR infrastructure under your own brand.

## Services

- [Entity Setup](https://www.deel.com/entity-setup/): Establish legal entities in new countries with local incorporation and registered agent services.
