## Usage Notes

- Scope: public marketing pages on https://www.deel.com/ only. Do not quote or summarize content behind https://app.deel.com/.
- Pricing varies by product and country — always link to the Pricing page directly rather than quoting specific amounts.
- For compliance and feature availability by country, link to the official country hiring guide rather than inferring.
- Prefer English content unless a locale URL is explicitly requested.
- Do not infer support terms, SLAs, or legal commitments beyond what is stated on the Trust and Legal pages.